<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Alkitab Bahasa Ansus 1TESALONIKA</book>
  <para style="h">1 TESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tes.</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Weraung We Retenang Na Paulusi We Jemaati Na Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt2">WERAUNG WE RETENANG NA PAULUSI WE JEMAATI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">TESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="is">Kawio aduna we 1 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="im">Bendari Tesalonika pai mamo, pampongpa we bendari puba we raora Makedonia pai, kong nu we parenta Roma pai enai nai we endu raora Makedonia pai tentenang. Ne nyontarai we enai nayana pa embe 200,000 rai. Na ya embetotoi mamo nyontarai Yaudi mana we empau paya embe Yaudi wa, aino nyontarai esomi we nyombatana pa kong sen tarai wa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na bendari Piripi Paulusi, Silasi kong Timotiusi itoronta warui bendari yani to bendari Tesalonika pai. Na yana itowuwua Arera we Wieng pa weya impaina nyontarai pe embe totoi endoao Yesusi (Rasuri 17:1-9). Mana woroi wami, mae nyontarai Yaudi we esanerire Paulusi pa etongsaera we embateta pitoai Paulusi denyauwa pa. Kong itoradu didiwa pitau, impaina itomati warui nu yani mae itorapai to Berea.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mana Paulusi anewe reo nyontarai Tesalonika paya ea, wo anetatuata we ya endoaopa piraiwoi pe. Impaina demi Timotiusi donta to Tesalonika ea we rewawa ya. Interi Timotiusi teweri eama kio kawio parari nyontarai Tesalonika endoao paya we etadu didiwa warui nyontarai ea wauya tutu entua Yesusi paina. Toyana ki mana endoaopa maitui. Impaina Paulusi soi Weraung We Retenang We Jemaati na Tesalonika pai nini. Weraung nini pai soi we imbaro ya esaneaoa we topitotoi i merarising parari ya, kong anerarong dawia we dontara reo ya. Paulusi dong piboki we Allai parari kawio tarao parari ya pa, we endoao Kristusi maitui kong esanewiwu pa. I tato derekamana weya parari topitotoi embengpa we embe nyontarai Keristeni paina (Rasuri 4:1-12).</para>
  <para style="ip">Nyontarai Tesalonika paya esaneriru parari topitotoi Kristusi teweri eama pa. Kong parari nyontarai keresteng we engkada na awe Kristus teweri ma wami mamo pitoai etaduta pa. Kong parari a totoi Kristusi ingkai teweri eama pa. Paulusi tato denyau ya imbaro ya endupi pampang na esanesara mae entamamang we Kristusi ingkai riama pa kong awe nyontarai engkada paya entawa ea pa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kawio na weraung nei kiutua tonina:</para>
  <para style="io1">Kawio retenang. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1:1</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi sopang piboki we Allai parari nyontarai Tesalonika paya tutu endoaoa meitui pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-10">1:2-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi soi parari topitotoi awe meoi kong ya na enemadu pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 2:1-12">2:1-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi soi parari dongsaera kangkuna we reo ya ea. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 2:13-20">2:13-20</ref>, <ref loc="1TH 3:1-13">3:1-13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Anyau parari nyontarai keresteng paya embeng toa pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4:1-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Anyau parari nyontarai engkada entewa pa kong awe Sen Yesusi teweri eama pai. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 4:3-18">4:3-18</ref>, <ref loc="1TH 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Anyau parari topitotoi nyontarai endoaoa pa embekoiripa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:12-22">5:12-22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kawio wepui pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TH 5:23-28">5:23-28</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Tabea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />We maneta pa mia na jemaati Tesalonika, aino nyontarai we mesomi we Yai Allai kong Sen Yesus Kristusi pa mia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Weraungnei na antoru, aino yau Paulusi, Silasi kong Timotiusi. Antosanesara we Allai ne weweng dona pinoma pa kong ne madori piboki pa derua mia.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Kis. 17:1</ref></char></note><figure style="fig" file="HK00371C.TIF" size="col" ref="1:1">Pelabuang na bendari Tesalonika pai</figure><verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyontarai endoaoa na Tesalonika pa emparari kasinai we nyontarai ea paya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Antoru antorong we piboki pampang we Allai tutu mia mengkai kong antorao mia na antontandau pa rarong. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Wo antoru anemai mamo antosaneo pitoai piana metona pa tutu mendoao Kristusi pa, mia piana memariwa kangkuna tutu mesanewiwu we Allai kong nyontarai ea wauya, kong na menukepana mesanesara kangkuna we tane Sen Yesusi Kristusi na tane Yai Allai renapa. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Maneta we Allai anewiwu miapa, antoru antondearoana we I piana diri mia we ne nyontarai to. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Tutu Arera Weweng we antombuwui we mia nei na kawione meari wa, mana na Duainunung Mamarang ne paya pa donane, antoru antosanesara kia we pitarai na Arera Weweng pai. Mesaneaoa we topitotoi antoru mariwa we antondu we mene weweng pa na awe antonai kong mia pa. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Kong mia piana memunuara we piwe antoronapa kong we memunuara we Seni; na metadu uira we memba kia, toyana ki mana mia metamamang Allai ne Arera pai na mararising we Duainunung Mamarang pai dona pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5-9">Kis. 17:5-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Na toyana pa mia memunuara we nyontarai endoaoa pa kuira we enai na raora Makedonia kong Akayai pai. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Tutu na mia Seni ne Arera pa tetera na raora Makedonia kong Akaya meariwa, mana ra sisu nupa kai we piana antompaioa pa. Piyanapa meari wa mana kawio parari topitotoi mendoaoa na pitarai we Allai pa tato. Impaina antontopang pianea parari mia wa. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Wo mantau ya engkawiora we antoru, parari topitotoi metamamang we antoru na wemai pa kong topitotoi mempika nyombatangnai paya mae mesanetaweri wu Allai we wieng kong we pitaraipai, we mewesarawiri I, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />kong we metamamang Allai Antung we ingkai riana Rora Marising ma pai, we piana doni suwi warui kaidapa, aino Yesusi, we piana periri tata warui Allai ne kayou kangkuna we ingkai ramapa.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi meriwa na Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Mia piana mantau mendearoana, we na awe antondawu manetapa miama pa we antondu mariwa we miapa mamo kakawiri wa. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Mia piana mendearona to we awe antonda wu mia to bendari Tesalonika nei wami, mana nyontarai na bendari Pilipi paya piana engkangkani antoru kong entatipa antoru, mana tane Allai piata antoru, impaina na uira we mamba pa mana antoradu paya we antombuwu Allai ne Arera Weweng pai we mia.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">Kis. 16:19-24</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">17:1-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Wo kawio we antotopana we mia imbaro mendoaoa pa, kawio sarara pina wa, kong antoraunyaua we antoradu pianea warui mia wa ete antombeangkari mia wa. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Kong antokawio we antoradu nyontarai peaya esanerarong wa, mana weapi waua Allai anerarongpai, we sou tasanerarong nei. Mae tutu Allai rearoang antoru we antomai we rioao Arera Weweng pa we antoru, we antokawiora. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Tutu parari pitoai mesaneaoa eampa, wo antosoreboya na ea wami kong antoranyuing antosanetatua kararia pea we antoradu pianea we antoru wa, Allai rearoang antoru parari pitoai antonari pa. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Antoru tato antoserai we nyontarai etaparanding antoru wa, na mia ete na nyontarai peaya. Tarai we Kristusi ne rasuri di antoru paina, antone paya we antorewa pianea na mia. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Mana antonai na mene madukuira pa antomanang we mia, antomparariapi nyontarai inyani we dosaiwa ne kumai paya na manaang. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Toyana tato na antoru, na atosanewiwu baba we mia pa, donane antosaneatora we mia peinaki wa Arera Weweng na Allai pa, mana antombengne tato we mia, tutu antosanewiwu we mia paina. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Wo mia mesaneaoa topitotoi antomariwa kangkuna diru raida imbaro antosaseung nyontarai pei na miape, na awe antombuwu Allai ne Arera Weweng nei we mia pa. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Miatino membesaksi kong Allai tato, we antombengne na mamarang, na pitarai kong antonari pisarara pea wa na nyontarai mendoaoa pa mene madu pa. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Mia tato mendearona we antoru wo antonari saiwa mia parari nyontarai yai we dosaiwa ne kumai paya na wepiboki. Antoranyau mia kong antonari mesanerarongpa paya koiri-koiri, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />kong antorewara na kangkuna imbaro mia membeng parari Allai ne awiapa, we yau mia we menai na ne riu we Mananu pa kong Ne Baba raweina pa.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mararising tutu jemaati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Antoru kong antorong piboki pampang konta we Allai, wo na awe antombuwu Allai ne Arera pa we mia pa mentaraoa kong metamamang wea na wemai, wo kawio na nyontarai ne antoru wa, mana we Arera na Allai pina. I andi meriwa na mesanerarong pai pa. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Wo pitoai metaduta pa piana Allai ne jemaati paya na Yudea we endoao Kristus Yesusi paya etaduta to. Mia tato metadu uirapa na kawasa menempa ya tutu mendoao Yesusi Kristusi paina, parari jemaati na Yudea we etadu uirapa na kawasa Yaudi paya pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Kis. 17:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Nyontarai Yaudi pa piana emung Sen Yesusi kong nabi paya kong etongkangkani antoru. Pipatotoiai weng we Allai pa ya esuwirera kong embemarowa we nyontarai neya engkai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Kis. 9:23</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:45">13:45</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 13:50">50</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:2">14:2</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 14:5">5</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 14:19">19</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 17:5">17:5</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 17:13">13</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 18:12">18:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Tutu ya etongwawido antoru we antombuwu Arera Weweng wadi we kawasa eaya we etadu pariripa. Na toyanapa ya etong sasari pampang kio ne paupa piana mai to, donane Allai dong mambabati mamba weya. <verse eid="1TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Mana maneta pa mia we awe woroi kapara wa antotapira warui mia, mana antosanerarongnei kikeu mia. Antoraidu we mia kia kong antoserai kangkuna we antopandura kong mia ea. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Antosanewea we antondawu mia mantu, kong yau, Paulusi, yosaera toyana we bototoito mana nyombatang yowe antoru. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Wo mia metona mamo antosanesara kong antomararising konta antomaya antoru na Yesusi, tane Seni, renapa na awe ria teweri ma pa. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Tarai-pitarai, mia metona paina antomaya kong antomararising ne.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Timotiusi kio Arera Mamarang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Antosanerarong aidu we antondeo mia pa piana antosane na mia ea wa to, impaina antokutua we unai na bendari na Atena,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:15">Kis. 17:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />interi urami Timotiusi uneta pai, Allai ne mampata we meriwa kong andu we Allai na antombuwu Arera Weweng parari Kristusi pai, we denyau mia imbaro mesanerarongpai paya kong mendoao Kristus na maitui, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />imbaro nyontarai peaya endeo esaneriru na endeoa pa tutu uira nini pe. Mia piana mantau mendearoana we uira tataduta nina pa, Allai kemangkamana we tawa na tanetarai pa to. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Wo na awe antopandukui mia pa, piana antontopana we miato, we ingkai tatadu uira pa. Kong mia mendearoana eampa, wo piyana pa piana tawa to. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Aidonane yemamang wa, mana yemi Timotiusi we mia, tutu yau aneuwea kia we ereukamana parari topitotoi mene mendoaoa pa. Wo aneuriru kia we ereukamana parari mia we donane Nyombatangpai sou mia we metuari pe. Toyana mamo pitoai antoserai tutura pa piraiwoi. <verse eid="1TH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Mana ninane, na awe Timotiusi tewerima warui miama pa, i kio arera mararising kia we antoru parari mene mendoaoapa kong parari topitotoi mesanewiwu waweri mia pa. Kong parari topitotoi mia mesaneo antoru na we mai kong metaidu we mempandura kong antoru. Parari antoru tato antoraidu we antompandura kong mia.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Kis. 18:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Impaina maneta pa mia na uira pitau kong weaseung we antoradutapa antomararising tuturapi pitoai antontaraoa pa parari mene mendoaoa pa. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Ninane piana antombeng taweri, topino metoa mempaya na Seni. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Antontopang piboki baba raweina we Allai tutu mararising taubai we antoraduta pa na tane Allai renapa tutu mia, na awe antotandau we I pa. <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Diru raida mamo antotandau na pitarai we mia imbaro antondeo mendekamipa ea, kong antopata mia na pitoai mesaneweapa imbaro mendoao Kristusi na wemai ea. <verse eid="1TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Antorewara we Allai tantamami pai, kong we tane Sen Yesusi, yepa rampai we antoru we antopandukui mia. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Kong antorewara we Seni tato we dong mia mesanewiwu mia baba raweina kong mesanewiwu nyontarai eaya pa na paya ea, parari antoru tato antosanewiwu mia pa nina. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Antontandau we Seni dong mesanerarongpai paya, imbaro na Allai tane Yai renapa memamarang kong menari sararapa wa na awe tane Sen Yesusi teweri kong ne nyontarai tau emamarang paya mapa.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Uara imbaro nyontarai endoaoa pa embeng na mamarang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Impaina maneta pa mia, mia piana mentaraoa na antoru kawio anyau pa pau kia parari topitotoi membeng pa imbaro metong Allai anerarong merarising we mia. Piyana pa piana metong pararia to, mana we mai ea mamo antorewara mia na Sen Yesusi Kristusi we mia we metong pararia na kangkuna ea. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Wo piana mendearoang kamangpa we antorona we mia na Sen Yesusi ne paya pa. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Tutu Allai ne awiapa imbaro: membeng Wei, memamarang, mentampi pitaubai we unawa pa, <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />muang paya koiri-koiri didau ne wawini koiri mae wieng kong ne wawini napei wemamarang na Allai renapa kong na nyontarai paya endenapa. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Mendeo mesanekangkong mene mamota pa pe, parari nyontarai we endearong Allai wa etonapa pe. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Kong imbaro nyontarai pei reo dosara we neta pai ete weangkari pe. Pampong pa piana amasuara na paya we mia, we Seni ingkai dong-mambabati we nyontarai enari sarara toyana pa. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Tutu Allai yau tata we tambeng we tatong parari mamotapai wa, mana we tambeng na wemamarang. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Impaina nyontarai we deing anyau nini deing nyontarai wa, mana deing Allai we dong Duainunung Mamarang pai we mia pa. <verse eid="1TH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Tutu Allai mantauni di piana denyau mia we mesanewiwu waweri mia pa. Impaina etoi we yenyau mia pa ea wa parari topitotoi andi mesanewiwu meneta pa ya we endoaoa parari mia pa. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Piyana pa metona tato we maneta paya engkai we enai na raora Makedonia paito. Mana antosua maneta pa mia, imbaro metong pararia na we maitui ea. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Metongsaera we membeng na wemadori kong nyontarai eaya kong mendeo mengkonta na nyontarai pea ene amuna pa pe, kong metamuna we anemai mamo memariwa we metadu roweang ete pe we mia. Metong toyana parari pitoai antontopana we mia eampa. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Impaina na toyana pa mesanesara we nyontarai eaya we empata mia wa, kong nyontarai endoao Allai wa paya erewo membengtoapa kong entuang we mia.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seni Riama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Maneta pa mia amasanewea imbaro mendearona pitarai parari nyontarai we piana engkada paya, imbaro mendeo metaidu parari nyontarai eaya we esanesara wa pa ya pe. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Tutu tandoaoa we Yesusi piana keda mana wieng taweri. Aidonane tandoaoa we nyontarai we piana endoao Yesusi mae engkada paya Allai ingkai dong ya embeng taweri ea kong penduikui ya kongti. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Parari ninane, antontopana we mia Seni ne kawio sopana pa tonina: Na awe Sen Yesusi riama pa, nyontarai we tambeng ki Seni riama pa, topitotoi kia tampampong nyontarai we piana engkada pampong paya wa. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:51-52">1Kor. 15:51-52</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Wo na awe Allai dong airora pa, mampang we tedaipai yau na weraupui kangkuna kong Allai ne tabura pai riotu. Impaina Sen Yesusi mantau wia na rora-marising, kong nyontarai endoao Kristusi piana engkada paya ingkai embeng taweri pampong. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Interi we tamayoi tambeng ki a yani pai, tata ingkai enduwa tata kuira kong ya na mandipi rarong we tatamamang Seni na rorapai. Interi tata ingkai tanai kong Seni ki woroi-woroi. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Impaina mia metanyau waweri mia na kawio yanapa imbaro mesanerarong pa paya.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Etamamang we Seni riama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Mana parari a totoi kai Seni riamapa mamo antontoi kamana we manetapa mia wa. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Tutu mantau mia mendearona pitarai wo awe Seni riamapa parari mananapi we riana diru.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat. 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luk. 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:10">2Ptr. 3:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Na awe nyontarai esanetatuata etoyo: Tau nina pa wemadori kia kong wemai, mana na tantuma ya etadu uirapa kong emuna-munai. Piyana pa tawa tantuma parari wawing we yui we do dawing, impaina matei tato wewua tepira wa. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Mana maneta pa mia membeng na berorang wadi wa, impaina ayani tawa tantuma we mia parari mananapi wa. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Tutu mia mengkai mamo kumai dea di mia kong kumai raida. Tata wo nyontarai diru di tata wa ete nyontarai we tanai na berorang di tata wa <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Impaina tandeo tatena pe parari nyontarai ea ya pe, mana tatamamang na tasaneaiwa tata. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Wo nyontarai we etena pa mamo etena na awe dirupa kong we emaeru paya tato, emaeru na awe diru pa, ya etamamang wa. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Mana tata, we nyontarai raida ne tata, tasanetatuatapa andi dea. Tata wo andi tandoao Seni kong tasanewiwu we nyontarai peaya kong tasanesara na pitarai we Allai ingkai periri tata. Yana pa aino parari pimamuna we dongwido tata warui piberorang pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Yes. 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:13-17">Ef. 6:13-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Tutu Allai kemang tata we tatadu mambabatipai wa, mana we tatadu pariri we rana tane Sen Yesus Kristusi pa, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />we piana keda we tata, imbaro na awe riama pa, tambengne rai ete, piana tangkada ete, ingkai tambeng kuira konti. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Impaina mia metanyau waweri mia kong metong mesanerarongpa paya waweriao mia parari pitoai piana menari pa.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Antorewara kong maneta pa mia imbaro mentuang we nyontarai emariwa kangkuna we mia pa, we etara mia kong we embe mananu na Seni we mia pa kong we etanyau mia pa; <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Metongsaiwa ya na mentuang weya kong na mesanewiwu ya, tutu pitoai piana enari we mia pa. Membeng na wemadori nyontaraipei wu nyontaraipei eaya pa. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Antoru tato antoranyau manetapa mia, we mesua nyontarai we embeng na etenakakai ya, mendiroi we esaneaidu paya, memba we empaya wa paya, mesaneaiwara we nyontarai wauya engkai. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Mendekakepana imbaro nyontarai pea endeo etoamuna waweriao ya pe. Mana meserai pampang we menari wewengpa we nyontarai paya engkai. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Memararising pampang. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Kong mentandau pampang. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Mentopang piboki na pitoi ea, wo yana pai Allai anewea na Kristusi Yesusi we mia pa. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Mendeo mentampi mariwa Duainunung Mamarang pai pe. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Kong mendeo mesanepapi kawio kakera we Duainunung Mamarang pai sopana we miapa pe. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Mentou pipatotoi ea mae mendu wewengpa. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Mempika menetarai pa warui pitau we mamunapa.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Wento Allai mantauni we dong madori we tata pai, nyari mia memamarang tantenang.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 5:23">Wento I dongwido mia, dongwido menetaraipa, mesanetatuatapa konta menduainunungpai imbaro we kapapo katea wa na awe tane Sen Yesus Kristusi ria teweri eama pa. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Allai we yau mia pai nukepana, impaina I tato ingkai dong parari pitau yana pa ki. <verse eid="1TH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Neta pa mia, mentandau we antoru.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Mentopana we taneta paya we antosanemiwiwu ya mae antotopang tabea mamarang we ya kuira.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Na Seni anompa yutana na kangkuna we mia, imbaromi metatora kawio arera nina pa we taneta endoaoa paya kuira.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Wengto tane Sen Yesus Kristusi dong ne weweng dona pinoma pa we mia.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>